.TH dalgon-dev-journal-torn 1  "dalgon-dev-journal-torn " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-dev\-journal\-torn \- Copy a journal with its tail cut mid\-record.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon dev journal torn\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIIN\fR> <\fIOUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy a journal with its tail cut mid\-record.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIIN\fR>
The journal to copy
.TP
<\fIOUT\fR>
The torn copy to write
